From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MoviePoop <dev@moviepoop.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:17:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] demux: avformat: don't let subtitle tracks hold back the PCR

The PCR is the lowest timestamp among tracks within 10 s of the newest one.
A subtitle track only produces packets when someone speaks, so after each
cue the PCR sits at that cue while audio and video read on, then leaps
forward by up to 10 s at the next cue or when the track leaves the window.

The input is paced by the PCR, so while it is stuck nothing throttles the
demuxer. The leap, with hardly any system time elapsed, exceeds CR_MAX_GAP
(300 ms), so the input clock logs "clock gap, unexpected stream
discontinuity" and takes a new reference point at the leaped-to time, which
keeps the read-ahead it has gained. It accumulates cue after cue, and each
discontinuity also disturbs output timing.

Seen on iOS with network MKVs: reading at many times the bitrate, memory
growing to the jetsam limit, runs of clock gaps, thousands of late pictures
dropped while audio keeps playing.

Only count audio and video tracks. Subtitles are muxed ahead of their display
time anyway, so nothing needs the PCR to wait for them.
---
 modules/demux/avformat/demux.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/modules/demux/avformat/demux.c b/modules/demux/avformat/demux.c
index 0a4cfbd..4cfd083 100644
--- a/modules/demux/avformat/demux.c
+++ b/modules/demux/avformat/demux.c
@@ -977,7 +977,8 @@ static int Demux( demux_t *p_demux )
     vlc_tick_t i_ts_max = VLC_TICK_MIN;
     for( unsigned i = 0; i < p_sys->i_tracks; i++ )
     {
-        if( p_sys->tracks[i].p_es != NULL )
+        if( p_sys->tracks[i].p_es != NULL &&
+                p_sys->tracks[i].es_format.i_cat != SPU_ES )
             i_ts_max = __MAX( i_ts_max, p_sys->tracks[i].i_pcr );
     }
 
@@ -985,6 +986,7 @@ static int Demux( demux_t *p_demux )
     for( unsigned i = 0; i < p_sys->i_tracks; i++ )
     {
         if( p_sys->tracks[i].p_es != NULL &&
+                p_sys->tracks[i].es_format.i_cat != SPU_ES &&
                 p_sys->tracks[i].i_pcr != VLC_TICK_INVALID &&
                 p_sys->tracks[i].i_pcr + VLC_TICK_FROM_SEC(10)>= i_ts_max )
             i_ts_min = __MIN( i_ts_min, p_sys->tracks[i].i_pcr );
